ng", "id": "964151325246560", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75443244_964151328579893_8461473694159931819_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EoBhJzEEt8MQ7kNvwHyL6Uv&_nc_oc=AdncxtQ_grTxc7uRTjjbO-j87S9F8pDhHbS1w4xf4qOL8gxKI1qdcYEOn9y2yjY-yn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvUZcyH-Cyt-0xs2NFs6yzEHmENKNyax8CIpYq7ZWgJvQ&oe=69A1A027"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "01-Thermal_Power_Plant_Image-01-Cover.png", "id": "710635164302527", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035385_710635167635860_999737385406583038_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zZyas8EiRTMQ7kNvwHh6_G4&_nc_oc=AdkCAljHYwP8H6ilvkIJzx2UQx0IByH_8KWsuk7hqDaipH45Bm1SVo5xPWtOjwYQyLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftqoWvivnuoXGMGhBPr1sMmwlJZchRNfuE2v57WEM91Dw&oe=69A194CA"}, "display_name": "Industrial Journey - Thermal Power Plant", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Power Up Your Learning with Our New Thermal Power Plant Module! \n\nElevate your journey on our platform with this immersive add-on. Dive into a virtual Thermal Power Plant, choosing between a guided tour for detailed insights or the freedom of Explore Mode to roam at your will. Witness firsthand the intricate workings of power generation. This module isn't just an addition; it's a gateway to understanding the dynamics of energy like never before.\n\nJoin us in revolutionizing the way engineering is taught. Embrace the power of VR to gain practical, in-depth knowledge in a truly interactive environment. Our VR engineering modules are more than just a learning tool; they are your gateway to mastering engineering concepts through modern technology. \n\nStart your virtual educational adventure today!", "short_description": "Dive into a virtual Thermal Power Plant, choosing between a guided tour for detailed insights or the freedom of Explore Mode to roam at your will.\n\nStart your virtual edu